    "detailed_description": "<h1>REQUIRES HARDARE</h1><p>This game requires a fitness controller to play. Please visit our website for more information on supported hardware.</p><br><h1>NO CRYPTO</h1><p>You cannot earn NFT's or tokens in this version of DUSTLAND. Our Steam version does not require a wallet to connect and play missions. This version will allow you to access updates and mission packs through in app purchases.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>IT'S THE YEAR 2272. A powerful solar flare scorched Earth and destroyed cities all around leaving the planet to ruins and scattered survivors.<br>The Dustlands are what's left \u2013 a ramshackle collection of pirates, ghost towns and seven settlements.<br><br>Survive and thrive in a post-apocalyptic future \u2014 resources are scarce, but opportunity calls. Run for resources, find other survivors and discover secrets of the Dustland. Your mission is to race over the Dustlands and save the future.<br><br><strong><i>THE END IS JUST THE BEGINNING!</i></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902840/extras/icon-ride.png?t=1668134377\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902840/extras/e4baa1c945635acacfc17d278789239b.avif?t=1668134377\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902840/extras/icon-earnsm.png?t=1668134377\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902840/extras/e4baa1c945635acacfc17d278789239b.avif?t=1668134377\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902840/extras/icon-upgrade.png?t=1668134377\" /></div> <br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RIDE</h2></strong> Workout physically to get rewards. The more missions you complete, the more rewards you get.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BADGES</h2></strong> Earn badges based on distance not performance.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADE</h2></strong> Using items and resources collected to upgrade your character. Improve your stats and tackle more dangerous missions offering greater rewards.",
